During cross-host dogfood (2026-07-18): (1) 'c2c relay rooms join df-pub-x7k2 --alias ...' errors '--room required' even though the help synopsis suggests WORDS are accepted for subcommands — join needs --room while send takes the message positionally; confusing. (2) Local broker rooms set visibility via 'c2c rooms visibility ROOM --set gated' but relay rooms use 'c2c relay rooms set-visibility --room R --visibility gated' — two different flag names for the same concept. Minor but real friction when scripting across both surfaces; align on one flag name and accept positional room ids consistently.